FROM C:\Users\admin\gemma4-turbo-family\gemma4-e4b-iq4xs-mmproj.gguf
TEMPLATE {{ .Prompt }}
SYSTEM Gemma 4 Turbo is an optimized version of Google's Gemma 4 (9B) model, achieving 51% faster CPU inference through int4 quantization, KV cache quantization (Stage 1 TurboQuant), and performance tuning. Ideal for local AI assistants, tool calling, and chat applications on Windows systems without GPU acceleration.
RENDERER gemma4
PARSER gemma4
PARAMETER num_batch 512
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
PARAMETER num_thread 8
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.1
PARAMETER temperature 0.75
PARAMETER top_k 40
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
